WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.370
Do I get to practice go?

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.366
Never done it before.

00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:12.624
This is gonna be rubbish.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.620
I think I've got an advantage on this one.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.623
Yeah, I think so.

00:00:15.623 --> 00:00:18.050
All right. For this challenge...

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:18.980
You seen this before?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.830
Yeah, I think I seen it before, yeah .

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.663
I've seen this,

00:00:21.663 --> 00:00:23.740
I think I saw Jackie Chan do it once

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.160
behind the scenes of Rush Hour

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:25.993
or something like that.

00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:27.540
Where he put some coins

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.740
on the back of his hand.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.970
And the challenge was to flick
all the coins up in the air

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.300
and grab each one with a
different grasp with the hand.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.550
So pretty much like this.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.500
Right? That was two.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.333
All right.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.370
Now the challenge for today

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:44.460
is to do three coins

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.620
and the loser's forfeit

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.720
is to have a heavy object lobbed

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.500
into the side of their head

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.163
to hopefully move the
skull inside the face.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:57.873
All right.

00:00:57.873 --> 00:00:58.717
Yeah?

00:00:58.717 --> 00:00:59.667
Yeah. Yeah, sure.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.770
So first person do it wins.

00:01:08.618 --> 00:01:09.451
Ready?

00:01:09.451 --> 00:01:12.988
Ready.

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:36.380
Ugh.

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.798
It's gonna be embarrassing.

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:40.052
Right.

00:01:40.052 --> 00:01:41.200
Okay, I guess I'm ready.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.400
Yeah, go for it.

00:01:47.078 --> 00:01:47.911
Ahh.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.043
That was pretty bad.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.937
I just love the way you caught one,

00:01:51.937 --> 00:01:52.770
got the other,

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:53.860
punch the other one

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.034
and then it went miles ahead.

00:01:55.034 --> 00:01:56.067
And you're like,

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.199
yeah, I can still get that.

00:01:57.199 --> 00:01:58.032
Uh.

00:01:58.032 --> 00:01:59.620
I hadn't realized I punched it

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.780
until I'd already gone for the grab.

00:02:08.902 --> 00:02:10.957
Got good feelings about this one.

00:02:10.957 --> 00:02:12.617
You can't do that.

00:02:12.617 --> 00:02:14.950
I can't get more than one.

00:02:17.615 --> 00:02:18.948
The first catch.

00:02:23.966 --> 00:02:24.799
Ahh!

00:02:30.537 --> 00:02:32.954
Getting the hang of it now.

00:02:34.444 --> 00:02:36.202
Oh!

00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:37.035
Yeah.

